# The whole company as a directory rather than the leadership as a tree. Forty-two
# people across five levels would run past 4,000px wide as boxes and connectors;
# indented rows put the same hierarchy on one readable page.
# Solid indentation is the reporting line; the dashed edge at the foot is
# design-system accountability that crosses from Product into Engineering.
